  "question": "Which buildings have 3+ mold reports in the last year?",
  "text": "There are 38 buildings with 3 or more mold reports in the past year. The building with the highest number of mold reports is 548 WILLIAMSON ST with 6 reports. \n\nSome of the top values are:\n- 548 WILLIAMSON ST: 6 reports\n- 817 LANGDON ST: 5 reports\n- 548 PROSPECT PL: 4 reports\n- 635 WILLIAMSON ST: 4 reports\n- 1409 E GORHAM ST: 4 reports",
  "sql": "SELECT p.property_id, p.address_norm, COUNT(r.report_id) AS mold_reports\nFROM fixit.gold.reports r\nJOIN fixit.gold.properties p ON r.property_id = p.property_id\nWHERE r.reported_at BETWEEN date_sub(CURRENT_DATE, 364) AND CURRENT_DATE\n  AND r.violation_category = 'MOLD_MOISTURE'\n  AND p.address_norm IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY p.property_id, p.address_norm\nHAVING COUNT(r.report_id) >= 3\nORDER BY mold_reports DESC",
